# Build outputs — regenerate with `make`
build/
*.stl
*.3mf
DIMENSIONS.md

# Review renders are regenerated by `make renders` / `make shots`. The few that
# the READMEs actually link to are force-added, so they survive a fresh clone.
*.preview.png

# Superseded files, kept locally for reference only
attic/

# fitcheck's scratch dir, beside the .scad it is checking. Removed on exit;
# this catches the ones a Ctrl-C leaves behind.
.fitcheck-*/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
